.TH AVR\-ORG\-EMAIL\-DOMAIN\-LIST 1 "" "avr 0.1.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-org-email-domain-list \- List email domains for automatic org membership (admin only).
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr org email-domain list
[OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
List email domains for automatic org membership (admin only).
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    created_at, domain, organization_email_domain_id
.fi
.RE
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-org-email-domain (1),
.BR avr-org-email-domain-set (1)
